---
/**
 * Shown on testnet portal and registration pages while no incentivized testnet is running.
 * Keep the wording in sync with docs/TESTNET.md (Part 3 status note) and docs/TESTNET-VALIDATOR-GUIDE.md.
 */
---
<aside class="incentive-notice" role="note" aria-label="Incentivized testnet status">
  <strong>The incentivized testnet is not currently running.</strong>
  We hope to run one in the future; announcements will be posted on our official channels.
</aside>

<style>
  .incentive-notice {
    margin: 1rem 0 1.25rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color, rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.35));
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-teal, #22d3ee);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    background: var(--bg-tertiary, rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.08));
    color: var(--text-secondary, inherit);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .incentive-notice strong { color: var(--text-primary, inherit); }
</style>
